{"id":"H0684","lemma":"אֹ֫צֶם","transliteration":"otsem","sayIt":"O-tsem","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ozem","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 1Ch.2.15;\nson of: Jesse (H3448);\nbrother of: David (H1732), Eliab (H0446I), Abinadab (H0041I), Shimeah (H8093), Nethanel (H5417H), Raddai (H7288), Zeruiah (H6870), Abigail (H0026H)(?) and Elihu (H0453J)\n§ Ozem = \"I shall hasten them\"\n1) older brother of David\n2) a descendant of Judah","glosses":["ozem"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ozem","kjv":"Ozem"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ozem","kjv":"and Ozem"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"1 Chronicles 2:15","note":"Ozem the sixth, David the seventh;","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0026","lemma":"אֲבִיגַ֫יִל, אֲבִיגַ֫ל","transliteration":"avigayil","gloss":"Abigail"},{"id":"H0041","lemma":"אֲבִינָדָב","transliteration":"avinadav","gloss":"Abinadab"},{"id":"H0208","lemma":"אוֹנָם","transliteration":"onam","gloss":"Onam"},{"id":"H0281","lemma":"אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ","transliteration":"achiyyah","gloss":"Ahijah"},{"id":"H0446","lemma":"אֱלִיאָב","transliteration":"eliav","gloss":"Eliab"},{"id":"H0453","lemma":"אֱלִיהוּ","transliteration":"elihu","gloss":"Elihu"},{"id":"H3448","lemma":"יִשַׁי","transliteration":"yishay","gloss":"Jesse"},{"id":"H1732","lemma":"דָּוִד","transliteration":"david","gloss":"David"}],"senses":[{"id":"H0684H","gloss":"Ozem","relation":"H0684H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}